<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">FIL</book>
  <para style="h">Filiipo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu Filiipo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filiipo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flp</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filipo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili Mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli havangimisi libundu li musyenge a Filiipo, mu taangu mudyenge a nde wa myole wu isalu hi buluumbi. Liina ni libundu latsomi, li Pahuli havangimisi hu tsi a Putu. Musyenge a Filiipo baatungasa hu Noode-Esete a tsi a Ngerese, mu itaanzi hya Masedonya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a Pahuli huli ba Mukristo ba hu Filiipo, li mu umweese itwadi hi mifudi, hi hili ŋa hati li iluumbi hya Kristo na libundu. Pahuli li mu utondo usinzahwadisa itwadi mo hiina. Bunuubu, nde mu kondaayi ali. Nde li mu umono pasi mu mutima, bu nde haveletwala ukumbasa bisu Filiipo. Pahuli li mu umweese bo, ki pila litondo nde hatondo bo. Nde li mu umweese bo kaka, munyongo a nde. Mu tooni ati, baatu bakima bali mu uyabisa bo Kristo mu manzila ma mabi, na batondi utelemene bo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:15-17">1.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:21">2.21</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:2">3.2</ref>,<ref loc="PHP 3:18">18</ref></char>). Pahuli na hiitu hi utsindaha batsyengi ba nde ba isalu hu musyenge a Filiipo, mu uhwadisa libundu na uyaka matsangu ma bo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2.19-30</ref></char>). Mu taangu mo yiina, ba Mukristo ba hu musyenge a Filiipo, baatsindihi misyendo huli Pahuli (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4.10-20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu Filiipo, li mu ufutala matondo huli ba Mukristo ba hu musyenge a Filiipo. Nde li mu uva bo mandoongi na li mu uhwadisa bo mu imiinu hya bo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli miisusa ŋa busu bwa bisu Filiipo, <char style="em">moonyi na lipfu la Pfumu Yisu </char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:6-11">2.6-11</ref></char>). Pahuli li mu ulongese ti, Yisu asiisi byosi bi nde haba na byo. Ni mu tooni mo yiina, Nzambi hasyenuli nde ŋa yulu bisiha byosi na ŋa yulu a baatu boosi. Ni bumosi kaka, nde mwakulu, Pahuli asiisi bambaahi ba nde ba baamonehele ba kabu li Bayudaayo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:3-10">3.3-10</ref></char>). Nde miisiinga natee umono pasi mu tooni a Yisu Kristo. Ni mu buuna, baabwahi nde mu kondaayi. Ni huuna, nde hamiivangama mu uyeholo muvumu a nde. Pahuli hasiidi buuna, mu tooni ati nde aba na hiitu ti, mbadi nde usuuha mu lipfu. Iluumbi Pahuli, li mu uleele huli bisu Filiipo, mu uduukala ifwaani hya nde (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:17">3.17</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:9">4.9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu musupuunu muhanda, Pahuli li mu umweese kinya yi imiinu hili mu uva nde. Nde li mu uhwadisa bisu Filiipo mu <char style="em">ubaaba mutso a kinya</char>. Kinya mo yiina, yili mu umonehele ŋa hati li ikolili na mapasi, mu taangu yi ba Mukristo bali itwadi ŋa hati la bo mwakulu, napa na Pfumu Yisu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Pahuli na Timoteho, baviha ba Kristo Yisu. Bisu lili mu usonehele muhanda mo wunuuwu, huli boosi ba baakangama mu Nzambi, mu itwadi na Kristo Yisu. Bisu lili mu usonehele huli bakuutu ba libundu, na huli bakeelisi ba libundu ba bo boosi, ba bali hu musyenge a Filipo. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Nyaha Nzambi Taata a bisu na Pfumu Yisu Kristo, bava benu hyese na hyenze.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miifutala matondo huli Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Me ndi mu upfutala matondo huli Nzambi, pasi taangu yi me ndi mu unzibwala moonyi mu benu. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Tangu yoosi yi me ndi mu utsambila mu benu, me ubaasambila na kinya. <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />Me umbaatsambila na kinya, mu tooni ati, benu laakumbisi me, mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe, umata ilumbu hyatsomi, natee bunuubu. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Me ndi na hiitu ti: Nzambi wu abaandihi usa isalu hi hibwe ŋa hati la benu, ukwilala mu ubaasa hyo, natee hu tsukusu, mu ilumbu hi Kristo Yisu hu uyafutaha. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Hu li tsiitsa ti, me mba na matsimi ma bunuubu mu tooni a benu boosi. Me ndi mu utondo benu mu mutima a me woosi. Mu tooni ati, benu laakumbisi me mu isalu hi Nzambi havidi me, mu hyese hya nde. Benu laakumbisi me ŋa me ambedi bunyanga, mu ulwanila Musamu wu Mubwe, na uyabisa nde na mifudi myosi. Benu a laasuki ŋaana ve, ka benu laakumbisi me kaka natee mu taangu mo yiniiyi, yi me ndi mu mapanga. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Nzambi yaabi ti me atondo benu mu mutima a me woosi, we bu Kristo Yisu hatondo benu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Mono ma me ndi mu upondo huli Nzambi, mu masambulu ma me ni ti, litondo la benu libaasinzakula. Me ndi upondo huli nde kaka ti, benu liyaba na utsikaha bubwe-bubwe, buni benu lafwana udyata ŋa busu bwa bana, mu nzaabili ya mbuli. <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />Ni buuna, benu luuyaba usilasa ndyatili yimbwe. Benu luuba banga imbuli na ba baavele na masyembo, mu ilumbu hya nziili a Kristo. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Benu luuba bisina bi mimbutu mi mavaanga ma mabwe mu Yisu Kristo, mana baatu boosi bava muyusu huli Nzambi.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musamu wu Mubwe miiyabaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Baana ba ngu, me tondi uyabisa benu ti mambu ma maayiili me, ni ma maasiidi ti Musamu wu Mubwe ayabaana mu mambuha moosi. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Ni mu tooni a maana, masadaadu moosi ma mu ubaakeelese pfumu a tsi a Looma, na bakima boosi, bayaba ti me ndi mu kondaayi, bu me umbaatsalila Kristo. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Titswene, bukondaayi bwa me bwamiihwadisa ba banzuhisini mu baana ba ngu, mu imiinu hya bo mu Pfumu. Na bo bali na ibahala, mu uyabisa Mambu ma Nzambi hwavele a boomo.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Mu mbuli, bana bali mu uyabisa Musamu a Kristo na nyengi, na mitsotso mu tooni a me. Ka bakima, bali mu uyabisa Musamu a Kristo na matsimi ma mabwe. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Bo baniiba, bali mu usa buuna, mu tooni ati, bo baatondo me. Bo bayaabi ti me ndi mu kondaayi, mu uvolele Musamu wu Mubwe mileembe. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Kabu latsomi la baatu, lili mu uyabisa Kristo mu mutima wu mubi. Bo bali mu usa lo na nyengi yoosi mu tooni ati, bayaabi ti me ndi mu kondaayi. Bo bali mu utsima urangisa mapasi ma me.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Liina a lili dyaambu la tsongo ve. Lo kaka a lili mu ukwamisa me ve. Tso hwaba ti mu matsimi ma mabi, buuve mu matsimi ma mabwe, la tsoongo ni ti, bo bali mu ulongese mambu ma Kristo. Ni mu tooni a maana, me ndi na kinya. Na me umbwetsinzamono kinya, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />mu tooni ati mapasi mo maana mu ubita hu liyobolo la me, mu nzila yi masambulu ma benu, na mu nzila yi likumbasa li Livupu la Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Li me ndi mu ukeele na usa hiitu mu lo ni ti, me a handi na tsonyi mu pasi dyaambu ve. Li me ndi mu utondo loloyi, we mu pasi taangu na hiitu hyoosi ni ti, Kristo uyaka muyusu mu nyutu a me. Me tso amba moonyi, me tso akwa.<verse eid="PHP 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Ka mu me, Kristo ni idiingu hya me. Na lipfu, aka ni kaluha a me. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Ka tso me mbwemba moonyi mu usa isalu hya kaluha ŋa toto, buuna me a hanzaabi hi me utsoolo ve. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Me amiiteleme ŋa busu bwa mambu moole. Tsimi a me yatsomi ni mu ukwa, mana me tsahala na Kristo. Liina ni li lafulala bubwe. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Ka hwafulala talu huli me, mu uba moonyi ŋa toto mo yiniiyi, mu tooni a benu. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi na hiitu mu liina, na me nzaabi ti, me ukwilala ŋa hati la benu boosi, mu ukumbasa benu. Mana benu likula, na benu liba na kinya mu imiinu. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Na bu me unzapfutaha huli benu, benu luuba na kinya yi yafulala mu tooni a me, mu mambu ma mabwe ma mali mu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mudingu wu imiinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Pasi bu buuyiila, dyataani we bu hwayelemene na Musamu wu Mubwe wa Kristo. Tso me nzidi, tso me pelinza, me mbanzuha babaaleele ti, benu laavangama mu matsimi mamosi, na lili mu usala itwadi mu mutima mumosi, mu ulwanila Musamu wu Mubwe wu bisu laayaki. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />A liba na boomo bu bambene ba benu ve. Mu bo, hiina ni iliimbu hya ti bo buudimbala. Ka mu benu, hyo ni iliimbu hya ti benu luuyoboho, na lo lili mu umata huli Nzambi. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Ka Nzambi hava benu hyese hi usalila Kristo, ndulu a mu usa imiinu hya benu mu nde ve, ka napa mu umono pasi mu nde. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Bunuubu, we bu benu liyabi, mudiingu wu benu lili mu ulwana, ni nde mumosi wu benu laamoni me mu ulwana hutsomi, na wu me kini mu umbwendwana.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Kulimini na bunene bwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Kristo li mu uva benu ibahala hi hyafulala. Litondo la nde libaava benu kwadisili na Livupu la nde libaatuunga itwadi hya benu. Benu laaluula mu litondo na kwili lingebe bana mu bana. A ni buuna ve? <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Ni mu buuna, kuhasaani kinya a me, mu ubaapfuuta matsimi. Baani na litondo limosi, mu ubaaba mutima mumosi, na matsimi mamosi. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />A lisa pasi dyaambu na matsimi ma nyeme ve, buuve mu nzala umonehele. Ka hutso a kulimini, mwesaani ti bana baakulala benu. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Pasi muutu mu benu, a hasaha ndulu kaluha a nde mwakulu ve, ka abaasaha kaka kaluha a bana.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Dyataani ŋa hati la benu, na matsimi ma baatu ba baakangama mu Yisu Kristo:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Nde wu aba ifwaani hya Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">a havatiini mu uba itsiitsa hya Nzambi ve.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Ka nde mwakulu abisi moosi mu uba muviha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Nde wu baabuti muutu ŋa hati la baatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">na baatu baamoni mu nde ifwaani hya muutu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Nde akulimini we ikenyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">na nde asiingili Nzambi te hu lipfu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:8">Eye! Tso lipfu la ŋa muti.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Ni mu buuna, Nzambi hasyenuli nde ŋa mbuha ya hati a yulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">na havidi nde nduhi yi yili ŋa yulu manduhi makima.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Mana mu muyusu a nduhi a Yisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">bya moonyi byosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">bya hu yulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">bya ŋa toto na bi bili hu tsi a babaakwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">bitsokomo.<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />Na boosi bayabisa ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:11">«Yisu Kristo ni Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">mu muyusu a Nzambi Taata.»<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwedeme we liyalala mu tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Ni mu buuna, bambaahi ba me ba litondo, benu laakasiingala ndongisili a me, ŋa me ambedi ŋa hati la benu. Ka bunuubu, singalaani yo bu hwafulala, tso me peli ŋa hati la benu. Mu mavaanga ma benu, mu boomo na likamba, mwesaani ti benu laamiiyoboho. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Ka ni Nzambi li mu uva benu matwala ma ukana na uvangimasa mambu, we bu hu li litondo la nde.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Saani moosi, hwavele miŋono na usobosono hu minywa. <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />Mana benu liba baana ba Nzambi ba baatsyeme na ba baavele masyembo, ŋa hati la baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi. Baatu ba bubaavaanga ma mabi na ba baatengeme matsimi. Benu lafwana ubaamwedeme we liyalala li libaayalusa tsi, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />mu uyabisa bo Musamu a moonyi. Saani buuna, ilumbu hi Kristo huuya, me umba na nyeme mu benu mu tooni ati, me a hatsali tso umono pasi mu pu ve. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Na tso makila ma me matsoli, we ikuku hi bungodu bu benu libaava huli Nzambi mu imiinu hya benu, me umono kinya. Me umba mu kinya itwadi na benu boosi. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Bumosi kaka huli benu, monwaani kinya, na baani mu kinya itwadi na me.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isalu hya Timoteho na Epafodite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Me ndi na hiitu mu Pfumu Yisu ti, me utsindahala benu Timoteho mawasa-mawasa, me ukwada bu me unzaka matsangu ma benu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Ŋa yulu a Timoteho, muutu mukima ndeve wu apfuuta matsimi na me, na wu li na nzala ukumbasa benu bu hwafwana. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Mu tooni ati, boosi ubaavangimasa ndulu kaluha a bo mwakulu, hwavele uvangimasa ma Yisu Kristo ali mu utondo ti bo bavangimasa. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Benu liyabi benu mwakulu, bu Timoteho hamweesi buni nde haba na tsongo mu isalu, we mwana ŋa pedu a taata a nde. Nde asali itwadi na me we ngamba, mu ulongese Musamu wu Mubwe. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Ni nde me ndi mu utsima utsindaha benu, ŋa me umono, tso bapalisi me mu kondaayi buuve naana. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Me ndi na hiitu mu Pfumu, ti tso Nzambi tondi, me mwakulu kaka unzaamono benu.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Benu laatsindihi me Epafodite, mu ubehele me likumbasa li me amba na lo nzala. Ka me moni bubwe, mu ufutala benu nde, nde wuli mwana a ngu a bisu, tsyengi a me wu isalu na wu midingu. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Ni mu buuna, nde li na lehemene li ubwemono benu boosi. Na nde li na mutima lehehe, bu nde hayuhi ti baamiiyabisa benu tsangu bubeedu bwa nde. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Mu mbuli, nde abeedi na ubeele, hwa ŋa pedu lipfu. Nzambi akwili nde lingebe. Ka ndulu a nde Nzambi hakwili lingebe ve, napa me Nzambi hakwili lingebe, mana me pelemba mu minyongo mi myafulala. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Me miindenge atsindaha benu nde mu mutima mumosi, mana benu liba mu kinya mu ubwemono nde, na lingebe la me lileenge. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Yakaani nde na kinya yindahi, nde mwana a ngu a benu mu Pfumu. Benu laafwana uba na likiinzu mu baatu boosi ba bubaavaanga we bu nde havangi, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />mu tooni ati, nde abeedi bebele na lipfu mu usala isalu hya Kristo. Nde avahuli idiingu hya nde, mu ubehele me likumbasa, li benu laavelitwala ubehele me benu mwakulu.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Mbiili ya mbuli mu uba wa tsiitsa ŋa busu bwa Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Na bunuubu, baana ba ngu a me, baani na kinya bu benu lili itwadi mu Pfumu. Ka huli me, me a handi mu umono budwa, mu ubweyabisa benu mambu ma me atsonihili benu ve. Na huli benu, mandoongi mo maana, mu ukandiha benu.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Kebaani mu bavangi ba ma mabi! Kebaani mu bamvwa mo baniba! Kebaani mu milongisi mi mili mu upfuta benu ti, tso a baakete benu ve, benu a lili mu kabu la baana ba Nzambi ve! <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Bisu ni ba Nzambi ubaamono ti bisu laamilwata iliimbu hya ba Mukristo ba mbuli. A bo ve! Bisu lili mu uyusa Nzambi mu likumbasa li Livupu la nde. Bisu lili na nyeme mu Yisu Kristo, na hiitu hya bisu, a hili mu bi muutu hu utwala uvanga mu mifudi mya nde mwakulu ve. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Mu umono bubwe, me kaka utwala usa hiitu mu bi muutu ubaavanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 3:4">Tso baatu bakima bubaasa hiitu hya bo mu mavaanga ma imuutu, buuna me kaka utwala usa hiitu hya me hu hwafulala mu mo. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Me, baaketi me mu ilumbu hya pwombo, hya hu mbisa a mbutili a me. Me musi Isereli mu ubuta, wa buli la Benyameni. Bakaaha ba me boosi bisu Ebeleho. Ka uto ti mu kiinzili mikele mya Moose, me ndi mu kabu li Bafarisi. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Ka uto ti mu lehemene li me ambedi na lo mu Nzambi, me akakwamisa bayihi ba Yisu. Muutu utwala usyembe me mu uvelekiinza Mikele ve, mu tooni ati, me akakiinza myo myosi.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ka bisiha byosi bi me akamono ti byo na pfuta yimbwe mu me, aka kaluha ve, mu tooni a Kristo. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Mu mbuli, me ndi mu umono bisiha mo biniibi byosi, bi byavele na kaluha. Mu tooni ati, busina bu bwafulala kaluha, ni nzaabili a Yisu Kristo Pfumu a me. Mu tooni a nde, me atsiinga utimba biina byosi bi byavele na kaluha, mana me mbuuna Kristo. Eye, me ndi mu umono byo we bya nzododo mu me. <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />Me atsiidi buuna, mana bayabiisa me wu akangama mu nde mu butsiitsa bu imiinu mu Kristo. A mu butsiitsa bwa me, bu buumata mu Mikele ve. Ka mu imiinu hi hyasiingama mu Kristo, me umba butsiitsa. Ni butsiitsa bu buumata huli Nzambi. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Hi me ndi mu utsaha hyoosi, ni uyaaba Kristo bubwe-bubwe, na uyaaba matwala ma tsuuhili a nde mu babaakwa. Hi me tondi, ni umono mapasi we bu nde hamoni, na ukwa mu tooni a nde, we bu nde hakwidi mu me. <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Ni mu buuna, me umba na hiitu ti Nzambi usuula me kaka ŋa hati la babaakwa.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiinu mu uyaka musyendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Me a handi mu undeele ve ti me amiinzaka musyendo, buuve ti me amiito mu itesi hya muutu wu akuha. Me ndi mu ukwada mu tiinu, mana me mbaha musyendo mo wuuna. Mu tooni ati, Yisu Kristo nde mwakulu amiibuuna me. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Baana ba ngu, mu me mwakulu, me a handi na tsimi ti me amiimbaha kaluha ve. Ka me ndi mu utsa isiha imosi: me ndi mu upusana ma mwakulu, na usa mifudi mu ubaalabitala ma hu busu. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Me ndi mu ukwada mu uyene tiinu hu busu. Mu tooni ati, Nzambi li mu uteele me mu uyaka musyendo hu yulu, mu itwadi na Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Bisu ba lili mu umono ti bisu ba laakula mu livupu, ni tsimi mo yiina yafwana ubaaba na bisu. Na tso mu dyaambu limosi benu lili na matsimi ma maasobono, Nzambi uyalusa matsimi ma benu. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Ka ndulu, mu itesi hi bisu a benu laamiito, lidyataani mu itwadi.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Benu boosi, duukalaani mbiili a me baana ba ngu a me. Bisu laaviidi ifwaani. Ni mu buuna, talaani buni huli ndyatili a ba bubaaduukala ifwaani mo hiina. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Ka, ba banzuhisini bali mu uvelesiisa mbiili a bo yimbi. Bo bali mu umonehele bambene ba Kristo wu akwidi ŋa muti. Me akandeele benu lo taangu yoosi. Ka bunuubu, me mbwendeele benu lo na bililu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Hu tsukusu idiingu hya bo, Nzambi ubungasana bo, mu tooni ati, bo ubaasaha uywatisa mapeyu ma bo ma musunya. Bo bali mu usuusa muyusu a bo mu moosi ma mu baamweese bo tsonyi. Bo ubaatsima ndulu mu bisiha bi idiingu hya ŋa toto. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Ka mu bisu, bisu baatu ba Ipfumu hi mayulu. Bisu lili mu usinzakeele nziili a Pfumu Yisu Kristo, mu uyayobolo bisu. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Nde ukimbusa nyutu a bisu yi yaatsambama, mana yo yifwanina na nyutu a nde yi muyusu, mu matwala ma nde. Ni nde li na matwala ma ususa pasi muutu na pasi isiha hu tsina lituma la nde.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Ni mu buuna, baana ba ngu ba litondo, me na lehemene li ubwemonono na benu! Benu lili kinya a me na mutata a me wa moonyi. Benu ba lili bambaahi ba me, kwilalaani ba baakangama mu Pfumu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandoongi ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Evodi na Syntike, me ndi mu unzayana benu, mu uyuhasana na ukangama mu Pfumu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />We kaka mbaahi a me wa taangu yoosi, me pondi we mu ukumbasa bakaasu baboole baniiba, ba baalwani na me mu mifudi mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe. Me a handimbili Kelema na bambaahi ba me bakima ve, ba manduhi ma bo basonehe mu Muhanda a Moonyi.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Baani na kinya taangu yoosi mu Pfumu! Me pfutahala: baani na kinya! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Nyaha baatu boosi bamono bulembo bwa benu. Pfumu aka bebele. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />A lihelene mitima mu pasi isiha ve. Ka mu mambu moosi, yabisaani mapondili ma benu huli Nzambi mu masambulu, mu manzayini, na mu pfutili matondo. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Na hyenze hya Nzambi, hi hyalutala buyedi bwosi, hyukeelese mitima mya benu na matsimi ma benu mu Kristo Yisu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Baana ba ngu, mu umana, nyaha matsimi ma benu mabaakwilala taangu yoosi mu biina byosi bi bili bya mbuli, bi byahwama, bi byasungama, bi byatsyeme, bi bubaatondo, bi bubaasingasala, bi bibwe na bi byahwama mu muyusu. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Salilaani ndongisili yi benu laayihi na laayaki huli me, mu mambu ma me na mu mbiili a me. Na Nzambi a hyenze, uba na benu.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miifutala matondo huli bisu Filiipo mu bungodu bwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Me amoni kinya yindahi mu Pfumu, mu tooni ati litondo la benu mu me, laabwebuta mbutu yi nyatihi. Litondo mo liina, benu laabeedi na lo, ka benu a laabahi nzila yi umweese me love. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Me a handi mu undeele buuna mu tooni manzala ma me ve. Mu mbuli, ka mu tooni ati, me amiinziha uba mu kinya, tso mu hoole hu me ndi na hwo. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Me nzaabi ubaaba hutso buyaha, na me nzaabi kaka ubaaba hutso busina. Me anzihi ubaaba na kinya, mu taangu yi me ndi na byudya bi byafwana, napa mu taangu yi me ndi na nzala, tso mu taangu a mvwadu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">taangu a mvwadu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">taangu yi bisiha bi bilahi.</char></note>, buuve yi limbunga. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Me utwala ukunda mambu moosi, mu likumbasa la Kristo wu ubaahwadisa me. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Bunuubu, benu laavaanga bubwe, mu ukumbasa me mu mapasi ma me.<verse eid="PHP 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />We bu benu mwakulu liyabi, benu bisu Filiipo, mu taangu yi me ambaandihi ulongese Musamu wu Mubwe, ŋa me apali mu itaanzi hya Masedonya, libundu tso limosi a laakumbisi me ve. Ndulu ni benu laakatsimala me, mu mapasi ma me na mu makinya ma me. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Ka tso ŋa me ambedi hu musyenge a Tesalonika, benu laatsindihi me likumbasa la mbongo tsindaha yoole, mu umana mapasi ma me. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Me a handi mu undeele buuna, mu ubwesaha uyaka bungodu ve. Hi me ndi mu utsaha ni ti, Nzambi asyeme benu mu bungodu bwa benu.<verse eid="PHP 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Mu muhanda mo wunuuwu, me ndi mu utsingasala ti, me anzaka bungodu bwa benu bwosi, bu bwavyohelele iteesi. Bunuubu, bu Epafodite amiibehele me bungodu bwa benu, me miimbaha byosi bi me ndi na byo nzala. Bungodu bwa benu buli we nyafi ya tsulu yimbwe, bungodu bu Nzambi ubaasiinga na bu nde ubaamono kinya. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Na Nzambi a me uluusa benu mu biina byosi bi benu laavele na byo, we bu hu li busina bu muyusu a nde, mu Kristo Yisu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Muyusu aba huli Nzambi Taata a bisu, mu bilima na bilima! Ameni!<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Vaani mabwehe huli pasi muutu wu li mu buli la Yisu Kristo. Baana ba ngu ba bali na me, bamiiva benu mabwehe. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Bangidi boosi ba musyenge mo wunuuwu, bamiitsindaha benu mabwehe, fula-fula ba bali mu usala mu nzo a Kayisaali, pfumu a tsi a Looma. <verse eid="PHP 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Nyaha hyese hya Pfumu Yisu Kristo, hiba na benu boosi.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>